.TH lprint-jobs 1 "LPrint" "2026-06-03" "Michael R Sweet"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
lprint-jobs \- list pending print jobs.
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.B lprint
.B jobs
[
.B \-d
.I PRINTER
] [
.B \-u
.I PRINTER-URI
]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
This command lists pending print jobs.
If not specified, print jobs submitted to the default printer are listed.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
The following options are recognized by
.B lprint jobs:
.TP 5
\fB\-d \fIPRINTER\fR
Specifies the printer queue to list.
.TP 5
\fB\-u \fIPRINTER-URI\fR
Specifies an "ipp:" or "ipps:" URI for a remote printer.
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.BR lprint (1),
.BR lprint-cancel (1),
.BR lprint-default (1).
.SH "حق نشر (COPYRIGHT)"
Copyright \[co] 2019-2026 by Michael R Sweet.
